          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/be35cbb0b16d97e82f5634e76314e87b430a9360"
        }
      ],
      "message": "test: p2p_v2_misbehaving: Handle partial ellswift read\n\nThe node's 64-byte ellswift key can arrive in several chunks. In that\ncase EncryptedP2PState.complete_handshake() returns (0, b\"\") to signal\nthat more data is needed. The WrongGarbageTerminatorState override\nbit-flipped the returned bytes unconditionally, which crashed in\nrandom_bitflip() on empty input and dropped the connection.\n\nReturn the \"need more data\" result unchanged before tampering with it.",
      "committer": {
